{"seq":1,"slug":"low-altitude-airspace","title":"低空空域管理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/low-altitude-airspace","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"低空空域管理体系\">低空空域管理体系</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>中国拥有全球最复杂的空域管理结构之一——军方管控的空域体系与民航运行需求之间的协调，长期制约着低空经济的规模化发展。2024年国务院发布《关于促进低空经济发展的若干意见》标志着低空空域改革进入加速期：从&quot;申请-审批&quot;模式转向&quot;分类划设-动态管理&quot;模式，为无人机和eVTOL的规模化运行铺平道路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-空域分类与结构\">1 空域分类与结构</h3><p>中国空域分类体系（参照 ICAO 标准并结合国情）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>高度范围</th>\n<th>管理模式</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>A 类</td>\n<td>FL600 以上</td>\n<td>严格管制</td>\n<td>高空航路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B 类</td>\n<td>FL290–FL600</td>\n<td>ATC 间隔</td>\n<td>航路/终端区上层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 类</td>\n<td>地面–FL290</td>\n<td>ATC + VFR</td>\n<td>终端区/进近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D 类</td>\n<td>地面–特定高度</td>\n<td>ATC 管制</td>\n<td>机场管制区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>G 类</td>\n<td>低空/非管制</td>\n<td>通告即可</td>\n<td>通用航空</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>W 类（试点）</td>\n<td>地面–120 m / 300 m</td>\n<td>备案/自动授权</td>\n<td>无人机运行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2024年起多地试点的&quot;W类空域&quot;（Warning Area for UAS）专为无人机设计，在特定区域内实现&quot;提交计划-自动审批-实时监视&quot;的简化流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-低空空域划设原则\">2 低空空域划设原则</h3><p>低空空域的划设需平衡安全、效率与公平：</p>\n<p><strong>隔离空域（Segregated）</strong>：无人机与有人航空器物理隔离</p>\n<ul>\n<li>适用阶段：初期/低密度</li>\n<li>优点：安全性最高</li>\n<li>缺点：空域利用率低</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>融合空域（Integrated）</strong>：无人机与有人航空器共享空域</p>\n<ul>\n<li>适用阶段：成熟期/高密度</li>\n<li>前提：可靠的 DAA（Detect and Avoid）能力</li>\n<li>挑战：法规认证、技术验证</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>动态地理围栏（Dynamic Geofencing）</strong>：基于时间和条件的电子边界</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Geofence</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>weather</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>traffic</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>events</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Geofence}(t) = f(\\text{weather}(t), \\text{traffic}(t), \\text{events}(t))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Geofence</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weather</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">traffic</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">events</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>根据实时气象、交通密度和临时事件（如大型活动、应急救援）动态调整允许飞行区域。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-空域数字化基础设施\">3 空域数字化基础设施</h3><p>低空空域管理的数字化转型依赖以下基础设施：</p>\n<p><strong>数字化空域地图</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>三维空域模型：体素化表达允许/禁止区域</li>\n<li>动态图层：气象、临时禁区、流量密度实时叠加</li>\n<li>标准格式：ED-269（EUROCAE）或 ASTM F3411 Remote ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>低空感知网络</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>雷达覆盖：低空监视雷达（探测低 RCS 目标）</li>\n<li>ADS-B/远程 ID 接收站：无人机广播位置</li>\n<li>光电监视：城市摄像网络辅助识别</li>\n<li>频谱监测：检测&quot;黑飞&quot;无人机的遥控信号</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>通信保障</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>5G-A/6G 低空网络：运营商部署对空覆盖基站</li>\n<li>卫星通信：偏远区域应急备份</li>\n<li>专用频段：C-Band 或 L-Band 航空数据链</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-空域容量与流量管理\">4 空域容量与流量管理</h3><p>随着低空飞行器数量指数增长，空域容量成为瓶颈。容量评估模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{V_{airspace}}{V_{separation} \\cdot S_f}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{airspace}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为可用空域体积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{separation}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单架飞行器所需的最小间隔体积（包含安全缓冲），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为安全系数。</p>\n<p><strong>流量管理策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>战略层（提前数小时）：飞行计划冲突检测与预调配</li>\n<li>预战术层（提前 15–60 min）：动态容量平衡与地面延误</li>\n<li>战术层（实时）：冲突探测与解脱（CD&amp;R）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>城市低空的特殊挑战：高层建筑创造的&quot;空域峡谷&quot;使有效容量远低于理论值；起降点（vertiport）集中在商业区导致局部拥堵。</p>\n<h3 id=\"5-中国低空空域改革进程\">5 中国低空空域改革进程</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>里程碑</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2010</td>\n<td>《关于深化我国低空空域管理改革的意见》</td>\n<td>首次提出分类管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2016</td>\n<td>通用航空&quot;放管服&quot;改革</td>\n<td>简化审批流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>深圳立法《深圳经济特区低空经济产业促进条例》</td>\n<td>地方立法先行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2024</td>\n<td>国务院低空经济顶层设计</td>\n<td>全国性政策框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>首批 6 省市 W 类空域试运行</td>\n<td>无人机空域实质性开放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>改革核心路径：军民协调机制优化 → 空域分类细化 → 数字化管理平台建设 → 从试点到全国推广。</p>\n<h3 id=\"6-国际比较\">6 国际比较</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>中国</th>\n<th>美国</th>\n<th>欧盟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主管机构</td>\n<td>军方+民航局</td>\n<td>FAA</td>\n<td>EASA + 各国 CAA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低空定义</td>\n<td>真高 1000 m 以下</td>\n<td>AGL 400 ft（Part 107）</td>\n<td>120 m（Open 类别）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无人机运行框架</td>\n<td>UOMS + 试点</td>\n<td>Part 107 + BVLOS 豁免</td>\n<td>U-Space 蓝图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空域数据标准</td>\n<td>在制定中</td>\n<td>LAANC 系统</td>\n<td>U-Space 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>融合空域时间线</td>\n<td>2027–2030</td>\n<td>2025–2028（UAS BVLOS ARC）</td>\n<td>2027（U3 完全服务）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2025年欧盟 U-Space U2 服务（包含动态地理围栏、冲突检测和流量管理）在多个成员国正式运行。美国 FAA 发布 BVLOS Operations Over People 最终规则，允许特定条件下的超视距飞行。中国民航局联合工信部发布《低空智联网建设指南》，明确&quot;网格化空域+算力调度&quot;的中国方案——将低空空域切分为标准网格单元，每个单元实时计算容量并动态授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>计算一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\times 1 \\times 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> km 的城市低空空域网格单元，在水平间隔 50 m、垂直间隔 30 m 条件下的理论容量（不考虑建筑物遮挡）。</li>\n<li>设计动态地理围栏的状态机：如何在&quot;暴雨预警&quot;事件触发时，从&quot;允许飞行&quot;状态安全过渡到&quot;禁止飞行&quot;状态，同时通知在空飞行器。</li>\n<li>比较中美欧三方无人机空域管理的异同，分析中国&quot;军民融合&quot;体制下空域改革的独特挑战。</li>\n<li>W 类空域的&quot;自动审批&quot;机制需要哪些技术前提？列出关键的系统接口和数据流。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>低空空域管理是连接技术可行性与规模化运营的关键桥梁。从分类划设到数字化管理，从隔离运行到融合空域，中国正以&quot;试点先行、逐步推广&quot;的路径推进低空空域改革。理解空域结构、掌握容量模型、熟悉政策演进，是低空技术工程师参与产业生态建设的必备知识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"低空空域管理体系","id":"低空空域管理体系"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"1 空域分类与结构","id":"1-空域分类与结构"},{"level":3,"text":"2 低空空域划设原则","id":"2-低空空域划设原则"},{"level":3,"text":"3 空域数字化基础设施","id":"3-空域数字化基础设施"},{"level":3,"text":"4 空域容量与流量管理","id":"4-空域容量与流量管理"},{"level":3,"text":"5 中国低空空域改革进程","id":"5-中国低空空域改革进程"},{"level":3,"text":"6 国际比较","id":"6-国际比较"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多机协同与集群智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/intelligent-control-navigation/multi-uav-collaboration"},"next":{"title":"无人机交通管理系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/low-altitude-technology/airspace-management/utm-systems"}}